1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:00,576
One inch.

2
00:00:00,576 --> 00:00:02,077
$440.

3
00:00:02,077 --> 00:00:03,981
And the one who spotted it...

4
00:00:03,981 --> 00:00:04,967
never blinked.

5
00:00:04,967 --> 00:00:08,137
Atlanta airport, 2025.

6
00:00:08,137 --> 00:00:10,830
Patrick returned a rental Volkswagen.

7
00:00:10,830 --> 00:00:13,755
From Thrifty, a brand owned by Hertz.

8
00:00:13,755 --> 00:00:15,276
The car rolled through an arch.

9
00:00:15,276 --> 00:00:16,541
Cameras. Lights.

10
00:00:16,541 --> 00:00:17,690
An AI scanner.

11
00:00:17,690 --> 00:00:19,560
Minutes later, his phone buzzed.

12
00:00:19,560 --> 00:00:21,406
Rear wheel. A scuff.

13
00:00:21,406 --> 00:00:22,397
About an inch.

14
00:00:22,397 --> 00:00:25,787
The bill: $250 for the repair.

15
00:00:25,787 --> 00:00:28,515
$125, processing fee.

16
00:00:28,515 --> 00:00:30,624
$65, admin fee.

17
00:00:30,624 --> 00:00:32,809
Total: $440.

18
00:00:32,809 --> 00:00:34,260
Then came an offer.

19
00:00:34,260 --> 00:00:37,267
Pay within 2 days, save $52.

20
00:00:37,267 --> 00:00:39,057
Within a week, $32.50.

21
00:00:39,057 --> 00:00:40,880
Patrick wanted to dispute it.

22
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:41,963
He opened the chat.

23
00:00:41,963 --> 00:00:43,170
It was a bot.

24
00:00:43,170 --> 00:00:45,028
It couldn't connect him to a human.

25
00:00:45,028 --> 00:00:47,315
It could flag his claim... for later.

26
00:00:47,315 --> 00:00:48,464
So he emailed.

27
00:00:48,464 --> 00:00:50,602
A reply could take up to 10 days.

28
00:00:50,602 --> 00:00:51,775
The discount?

29
00:00:51,775 --> 00:00:53,165
Gone after 7.

30
00:00:53,315 --> 00:00:55,149
Hertz later said a live agent

31
00:00:55,149 --> 00:00:56,194
checked the photos and

32
00:00:56,194 --> 00:00:57,898
confirmed the damage was new.

33
00:00:57,898 --> 00:01:00,708
But look at that $125 again.

34
00:01:00,708 --> 00:01:01,729
Hertz calls it

35
00:01:01,729 --> 00:01:05,744
"the cost to detect and estimate the damage."

36
00:01:05,744 --> 00:01:07,404
The scanner found the scuff...

37
00:01:07,404 --> 00:01:10,230
and the bill had a line for that, too.
